          "_key": "6b7302366b7f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Frequently Asked Questions – Student Visa from Nepal"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3a255a175bfb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bbb025d43cad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "1. What documents are required for a student visa from Nepal?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "108bf0b12f7b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a5be8130fdaa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A valid passport, offer letter, academic transcripts, English test scores, financial proof, SOP and medical reports (such as a TB test) are usually required. Some countries also ask for a police clearance certificate."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b893b76bfb1e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ba6f97810e41",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "2. Is IELTS mandatory for a student visa from Nepal?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "48085abf268f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "237a8a7ccf9e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No, IELTS is not always mandatory. Some universities offer IELTS waivers based on academic background or medium of instruction."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c91c287ef29e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7e511ca0be8c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "3. How much bank balance is required for a student visa from Nepal?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9f12a55a34aa",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "30bd665225cd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The required amount depends on the country, tuition fees and living costs. The statement period also varies: for a UK student visa, the funds must be held for 28 consecutive days."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "975cde777435",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5993080e47ce",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "4. Who can sponsor a student visa from Nepal?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6f868b3c0ad7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7e96d3ec147c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Parents, legal guardians, or close blood relatives can sponsor a student visa, provided they submit valid financial proof."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8db89101edb8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "29311b93e33b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "5. Is a Police Clearance Certificate compulsory?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "13bba90fd639",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6fdf6fe98ed3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "It depends on the country. Some countries ask for a Police Clearance Certificate issued by Nepal Police; it is not usually needed for a UK student visa. Your Admizz counselor will confirm what your destination requires."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cfc0f4abb362",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c47c95cf85a5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "6. What is an SOP and why is it important?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9829d67dd6cd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6ebfc70e5d38",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A Statement of Purpose explains your study goals, career plans, and intent to return. A strong SOP improves visa approval chances."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f47a0b92e460",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "df7b2b728e19",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "7. Can I apply for a student visa before completing my degree?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3d1e959b548f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a85df21d247f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, provisional certificates or expected graduation letters are accepted by many universities and embassies."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8f699af29091",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "52b45f752b7d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "8. How long does the student visa process take from Nepal?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a5fd17a16d08",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b573c5b993fd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Processing time varies by country, usually ranging from 2 to 8 weeks after biometrics submission."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c0ccd39bb6f6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d9a36ef302f7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "9. What are the main reasons for student visa rejection in Nepal?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8b33d1a9f24b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "78da0043a3c9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Common reasons include weak SOP, insufficient funds, document inconsistencies, and unclear study plans."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
